#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:5
#: 53aa2a3fdf654f3e99473e8562a292e3
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr "FrSky 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:7
#: 864a4b5ab7a14152afe8fd8afcd5f852
msgid ""
"FrSky telemetry allows you to display ArduPilot information such as flight "
"modes, battery level, and error messages, as well as information from "
"additional FrSky sensors on `OpenTx <https://www.open-tx.org/>`__ compatible"
" RC transmitters and even older X9R transmitters (although with more limited"
" capability)."
msgstr ""
"FrSky 数传让您可以在 `OpenTX <https://www.open-tx.org/>`__ 兼容遥控器乃至旧款 X9R "
"遥控器（功能较有限）上显示 ArduPilot 信息，如飞行模式、电量和错误消息，以及其他 FrSky 传感器的信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:13
#: 72d937002dff479eb9336b2d61a65a1c
msgid "It is particularly useful:"
msgstr "它在以下场景中尤为有用："

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:10
#: d619c9da8f554c92b54c9bb2ff03e507
msgid ""
"for flying without a ground control station (no need for MAVLink telemetry "
"radio),"
msgstr "无地面控制站飞行（无需 MAVLink 数传电台），"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:11
#: 5fd27c95ec86420fa710ba8db93f4118
msgid ""
"as a backup in case the ground station fails (e.g., loss of MAVLink radio "
"link),"
msgstr "地面站故障时的备份（如 MAVLink 无线链路丢失），"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:12
#: 504773a4c48a4644985a5f8e4759c70b
msgid "when a separate person operates the ground control station,"
msgstr "由单独人员操控地面控制站时，"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:13
#: 36f5ad9200524ff6b868c54376eb7e4d
msgid "for quick situational awareness by the pilot."
msgstr "飞手的快速态势感知。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:15
#: 8718efc4d7844e8a83009de4820a4065
msgid ""
"Moreover, some RC transmitters such as the Taranis series, Horus, and T16, "
"can be configured to play sounds, vibrate or perform automatic RC actions "
"based on telemetry information through the highly configurable OpenTX "
"firmware."
msgstr ""
"此外，部分遥控器（如 Taranis 系列、Horus 和 T16）可通过高度可配置的 OpenTX "
"固件，根据数传信息播放声音、振动或执行自动遥控操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:21
#: 6a5c08bf8b02471381895bee648a3887
msgid ""
"Common FrSky Telemetry Setup with OpenTX transmitter running "
":ref:`FlightDeck <common-frsky-flightdeck>` or :ref:`Yaapu Telemetry Script "
"<common-frsky-yaapu>`."
msgstr ""
"使用运行 :ref:`FlightDeck <common-frsky-flightdeck>` 或 :ref:`Yaapu Telemetry 脚本 "
"<common-frsky-yaapu>` 的 OpenTX 遥控器的常用 FrSky 数传设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:23
#: 3a8ddcf05dec417c8f2665eafa7f67cc
msgid ""
"before the addition of FrSky telemetry protocols to ArduPilot, it was "
"necessary to use an external converter to convert normal MAVLink telemetry "
"from the Autopilot into FrSky Sport compatible telemetry (See :ref:`common-"
"frsky-mavlink`), but this is no longer required. However, the `MAV2PT "
"converter <https://www.rcgroups.com/forums/showthread.php?3089648-Mavlink-"
"To-FrSky-Passthrough-Converter>`__ is especially useful for converting "
"MAVLink telemetry output from many long-range RC systems for display on an "
"OpenTX transmitter or forwarding via Bluetooth or WiFi to a smarphone or PC "
"running a Ground Control Station."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 添加 FrSky 数传协议之前，需要使用外置转换器将飞控的普通 MAVLink 数传转换为 FrSky Sport "
"兼容数传（参见 :ref:`common-frsky-mavlink`），但现在已不再需要。然而，`MAV2PT 转换器 "
"<https://www.rcgroups.com/forums/showthread.php?3089648-Mavlink-To-FrSky-"
"Passthrough-Converter>`__ 对于将许多长距离遥控系统的 MAVLink 数传输出转换后在 OpenTX "
"遥控器上显示，或通过蓝牙/WiFi 转发到运行地面控制站的智能手机或 PC 上，仍然特别有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:27
#: acff462a06cb4782b8a2de088d10b120
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:29
#: c560e3a52314435a8ff4f6750d252080
msgid "In order to use FrSky telemetry, the following steps are required:"
msgstr "使用 FrSky 数传需要以下步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:31
#: eff8a0e480314dc5b5972e42f6589930
msgid ""
"Connect an autopilot telemetry port to an FrSky receiver which has an SPort "
"or Fport interface. This may require a bi-directional inverter depending on "
"which autopilot it being used. See :ref:`common-connecting-sport-fport`."
msgstr ""
"将飞控数传接口连接到具有 SPort 或 Fport 接口的 FrSky 接收机。根据所使用的飞控，可能需要双向逆变器。参见 :ref:`common-"
"connecting-sport-fport`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:32
#: 6dabbd80c7184677a5b29bb25d75a65d
msgid "Configure the autopilot."
msgstr "配置飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:33
#: 558343ac20f64190bfb1f6126735d521
msgid ""
"Install a LUA script to display the full telemetry. (Although is it possible"
" to display a subset of telemetry values using OpenTX's built in telemetry "
"screens, it is very limited.)"
msgstr "安装 LUA 脚本以显示完整数传。（虽然可以使用 OpenTX 内置数传屏幕显示部分数传值，但功能非常有限。）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:37
#: d9240ac72ee342718ff6f598d833dd95
msgid "Connection Diagrams"
msgstr "连接示意图"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:43
#: 8152788bcd9a45bb9f8872f90968a439
msgid "See"
msgstr "参见"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:45
#: b0d42870d6d644e48f7a7891fe89368d
msgid "for connection diagrams."
msgstr "获取连接示意图。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:49
#: f39d1f4a3cef4fdb9613e91a0cafd85f
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:51
#: f3da4719b3dc4b43a63ea9950f7e88ff
msgid ""
"Two protocols are available, Repurposed and PassThrough. Repurposed has been"
" superseded by PassThrough since much more telemetry information can be "
"transferred and displayed."
msgstr "提供两种协议：复用和直通。由于直通协议可以传输和显示更多数传信息，它已经取代了复用协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:53
#: 0ae22a1615be4f648819218fee82daa4
msgid "First set the SERIALxPROTOCOL to \"10\" for the telemetry port used."
msgstr "首先将所用数传接口的 SERIALxPROTOCOL 设置为「10」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:55
#: f8ff1b4796d04d81866b96fcc9f49697
msgid ""
"SERIAL port numbers do not necessarily directly correspond to UART or TELEM "
"port labels. See the hardware documentation for your :ref:`autopilot "
"<common-autopilots>`."
msgstr ""
"SERIAL 接口编号不一定直接对应 UART 或 TELEM 接口标签。请参阅您的 :ref:`飞控 <common-autopilots>` "
"硬件文档。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:57
#: a64a688a268641af86780ddf832c09d3
msgid ""
"If you have an F7 or H7 autopilot, and therefore do not need to use an "
"external inverter, you must turn on the inverters for the SERIAL port and "
"also set it to half duplex."
msgstr "如果使用 F7 或 H7 飞控，因此不需要外置逆变器，则必须开启 SERIAL 接口的逆变器并将其设置为半双工。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:59
#: 71d8b95df38e49d68580b9261748c163
msgid "Any configuration change to a UART requires a re-boot to take effect."
msgstr "对 UART 的任何配置更改均需重启后生效。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:62
#: 7d4b62d28b7e4405a191b4d89b9e28e9
msgid ""
"In general, F4 based autopilots using an external bi-directional inverter "
"can use any UART with the following configuration:"
msgstr "通常，使用外置双向逆变器的基于 F4 的飞控可以在任意 UART 上使用以下配置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:64
#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:69
#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:77
#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:82
#: 1126fb6f4630489fabc5a9e8811ca579 2de05285440a45d7a424f67d54f2e52c
#: 33265c9e4f444d708a59fd76aa3be203 c02ce9ef74414e798e7b477901c1afc6
msgid "``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` =10"
msgstr "``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` =10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:65
#: 0eded3ff63524ed6af5ffa6f22fedb13
msgid ""
"``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` =160 (enable pull-up/pull-downs on TX and RX pins for "
"those external inverter circuits that may require it)"
msgstr "``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` =160（在 TX 和 RX 引脚上启用上拉/下拉，适用于可能需要此功能的外置逆变器电路）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:67
#: 1440a6cc7a1f49519bed5e84ed2a064f
msgid ""
"F4 based autopilots using an \"inverted SPort\" output from the receiver can"
" connect it to any  UART's TX pin with the configuration:"
msgstr "使用接收机「反相 SPort」输出的基于 F4 的飞控可将其连接到任意 UART 的 TX 引脚，配置如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:70
#: 614968a2729f49f1ba09e47add12c579
msgid "``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` = 4 (Half Duplex)"
msgstr "``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` = 4（半双工）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:72
#: ea878ff7a175492dbe92e2d365c9ef69
msgid ""
"F4 based autopilots cannot use the RX pin with an \"inverted SPort\" output "
"since the SWAP capability is only available in F7/H7 based autopilots."
msgstr "基于 F4 的飞控不能在「反相 SPort」输出时使用 RX 引脚，因为 SWAP 功能仅在基于 F7/H7 的飞控中可用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:75
#: fc568f68d6574d9798a1468fc910d5d4
msgid ""
"F7/H7 based autopilots can directly connect to the TX pin of any UART and "
"use this configuration:"
msgstr "基于 F7/H7 的飞控可直接连接到任意 UART 的 TX 引脚，并使用以下配置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:78
#: b9492fe17b074c97bcab3040ec1b6599
msgid "``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` =  7 (invert TX/RX,Half Duplex)"
msgstr "``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` =  7（反相 TX/RX，半双工）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:80
#: 30a9fd82d57647a29c3a78dbdcd15164
msgid "OR to the RX pin:"
msgstr "或连接到 RX 引脚："

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:83
#: 8ef658ecbccf465fb2b724814118e6d7
msgid "``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` =  15 (invert TX/RX,Half Duplex, SWAP TX/RX pins)"
msgstr "``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` =  15（反相 TX/RX，半双工，交换 TX/RX 引脚）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:86
#: c30ecf0b49174affb8ae9e5fb6ac2a97
msgid ""
"Some F7/H7 autopilots have level/shifters on their UARTs that cause a delay "
"in Half Duplex operation, like CubeOrange. If the above configuration does "
"not, try setting :ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` = 8 which will add padding in"
" the protocol to accommodate this. However, using this option when not "
"required will break operation."
msgstr ""
"部分 F7/H7 飞控（如 CubeOrange）的 UART 上有电平转换器，导致半双工操作延迟。如果上述配置无效，可尝试将 "
":ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` 设置为 8，这将在协议中添加填充以适应此延迟。但如果不需要此选项时使用它，则会导致操作失败。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:88
#: 488f3577393241148ca9eff3cdeb3166
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`FRSKY_OPTIONS<FRSKY_OPTIONS>` bit 0 to \"1\" to enable sending "
"alternating airspeed and groundspeed data to the display script. The "
":ref:`Yaapu FrSky Telemetry Script for OpenTX <common-frsky-yaapu>` can use "
"this but it may cause other display apps/scripts to alternate the speed "
"value readout."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`FRSKY_OPTIONS<FRSKY_OPTIONS>` 第 0 "
"位设置为「1」以启用向显示脚本交替发送空速和地速数据。:ref:`Yaapu FrSky Telemetry Script for OpenTX "
"<common-frsky-yaapu>` 可以使用此功能，但它可能导致其他显示应用/脚本交替显示速度值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:91
#: 969c390d8a6c41499b96d3c9b01c0226
msgid "Display Scripts"
msgstr "显示脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:93
#: 09e402afb8664d3d977283227509b7a6
msgid "Several options are available:"
msgstr "有多个选项可供选择："

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:102
#: 3b91fe685212427ca81c01c49cf039f2
msgid "Turnigy 9XR Pro"
msgstr "Turnigy 9XR Pro"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:104
#: ec1fbce5a9984f6f8be1ab7eb6027f70
msgid ""
"This section describes how to enable FrSky telemetry on the Turnigy 9XR Pro "
"transmitter."
msgstr "本节介绍如何在 Turnigy 9XR Pro 遥控器上启用 FrSky 数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:108
#: c5d2dee1362340aa90f73e36da6e1f62
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "要求"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:110
#: a27bc72680de40d88fa195c01814fa58
msgid ""
"You will need a transmitter module with support for FrSky telemetry, such as"
" the ``FrSky XJT``.  The DJT_ also supports telemetry, but you will need to "
"use an external cable to connect the telemetry data from the module to your "
"transmitter."
msgstr ""
"您需要一个支持 FrSky 数传的发射机模块，例如 ``FrSky XJT``。DJT_ 也支持数传，但需要使用外置线缆将数传数据从模块连接到遥控器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:115
#: 1f2ee54d0cd249628aa6d60a87b70108
msgid "The instructions in this section are specifically for the XJT module."
msgstr "本节中的说明专门针对 XJT 模块。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:118
#: b36389f60ce347dabf340f2263ea7eef
msgid ""
"You will need to be running a recent version (211 or later) of the ErSky9x "
"firmware.  You can find more information about upgrading the firmware and "
"about ErSky9x in general from `the documentation`_."
msgstr ""
"您需要运行较新版本（211 或更高版本）的 ErSky9x 固件。有关升级固件和 ErSky9x 的更多信息，请参见 `文档 <the "
"documentation>`_。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:128
#: 35bb4418c06045de946b1dd168ebfd91
msgid "Configuring ArduPilot"
msgstr "配置 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:130
#: 9039eff4e34941ea96d98756d74cb5d1
msgid ""
"Ensure that you have the appropriate ``SERIAL#_PROTOCOL`` parameter set to "
"``10`` (\"passthrough FrSky telemetry\") to select the ArduPilot SPORT "
"protocol.  For example, if you have plugged your SmartPort cable into the "
"serial 4/5 port on your Pixhawk, set ``SERIAL4_PROTOCOL`` to ``10``."
msgstr ""
"确保为所用数传接口设置了适当的 ``SERIAL#_PROTOCOL`` 参数为 ``10``（「直通 FrSky 数传」）以选择 ArduPilot "
"SPORT 协议。例如，如果将 SmartPort 线缆插入 Pixhawk 的串口 4/5，请将 ``SERIAL4_PROTOCOL`` 设置为 "
"``10``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:136
#: a53f0606658942fcb738b93f069268a8
msgid "Reboot your controller after making this change."
msgstr "更改后重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:138
#: 7449179e14d34a67b7a1366e731d6693
msgid ""
"ErSky9x will also work with protocol ``4`` (\"repurposed FrSky telemetry\"),"
" but you will not have access to ArduPilot-specific information such as the "
"name of the current flight mode or arming status."
msgstr ""
"ErSky9x 也可以与协议 ``4``（「复用 FrSky 数传」）配合使用，但您将无法访问 ArduPilot "
"特有的信息，如当前飞行模式名称或解锁状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:144
#: b0d76d68d61b42049610f8940569f83a
msgid "Configuring the 9XR Pro"
msgstr "配置 9XR Pro"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:146
#: 985d0962fa5946759b9a90e67c2b86df
msgid ""
"Verify that you are running version 211 or later.  Navigate to the ``Radio "
"Setup`` menu and then select ``Version``.  Look at the ``SVN`` field."
msgstr ""
"确认您运行的是 211 或更高版本。导航到 ``Radio Setup`` 菜单，然后选择 ``Version``。查看 ``SVN`` 字段。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:154
#: 0f6dfbbea8784dda99115192b31a6e7e
msgid "Telemetry support is substantially improved in revision 218 and later."
msgstr "数传支持在修订版 218 及更高版本中有了实质性改进。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:157
#: 1fde9aad62dd4fb39961f699daaa5027
msgid ""
"Navigate to ``Model Setup`` menu, then select ``Protocol``.  Ensure that you"
" have ``Proto`` set to ``XJT``, and ``Type`` set to ``D16``."
msgstr ""
"导航到 ``Model Setup`` 菜单，然后选择 ``Protocol``。确保 ``Proto`` 设置为 ``XJT``，``Type`` "
"设置为 ``D16``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:164
#: 11101884c7ab4f43a4ea0e33c0dc3b74
msgid "In older versions of the firmware, you may see `PXX` instead of `XJT`."
msgstr "在较旧版本的固件中，您可能看到 `PXX` 而不是 `XJT`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:167
#: 8db0109826914d58a0c2f6536fa73fa4
msgid ""
"Navigate to the ``Model Setup`` menu, then select ``Telemetry``, and then "
"again select ``Telemetry`` from the popup menu.  Ensure that ``UsrProto`` is"
" set to ``ArduP`` (for ArduPlane) or ``ArduC`` (for ArduCopter), ``Telemetry"
" Com Port`` (previously ``FrSky Com Port``) is ``1``, and ``Com Port "
"Invert`` (previously ``Invert Com 1``) is off (unchecked)."
msgstr ""
"导航到 ``Model Setup`` 菜单，然后选择 ``Telemetry``，再从弹出菜单中再次选择 ``Telemetry``。确保 "
"``UsrProto`` 设置为 ``ArduP``（ArduPlane）或 ``ArduC``（ArduCopter），``Telemetry Com"
" Port``（以前称为 ``FrSky Com Port``）为 ``1``，``Com Port Invert``（以前称为 ``Invert "
"Com 1``）处于关闭（未勾选）状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:182
#: f141276baf9f4a7f905b3d8010f43ca6
msgid ""
"If you are using something other than ArduPlane or ArduCopter, you can set "
"``UsrProto`` to ``FrSky``.  You will get a more basic telemetry display that"
" will be missing things like the graphic heading indicator, the name of the "
"current flight mode, and so forth."
msgstr ""
"如果使用的不是 ArduPlane 或 ArduCopter，可以将 ``UsrProto`` 设置为 "
"``FrSky``。您将获得更基础的数传显示，缺少图形航向指示器、当前飞行模式名称等内容。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:188
#: c5b4b28dfc7f4d28bf6e834381801de3
msgid ""
"At this point, you should be receiving extended telemetry on your 9XR Pro.  "
"If you navigate to the telemetry home screen (use the up/down arrows to "
"switch between screens) you should see standard FrSky telemetry values (such"
" as RSSI, receiver voltage, etc) as well as extended telemetry, such as "
"flight mode, current measurements, GPS information, etc."
msgstr ""
